  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judicial System Modernization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin del Sistema Judicial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOCUS ON MODERNIZING SEVERAL AREAS OF THE HONDURAN JUSTICE SYSTEM TO ENSURE THAT THE SYSTEM IS FAIR AND INDEPENDENT, ACCESSIBLE TO ALL CITIZENS AND WILL FOSTER SUTAINABLE SOCIO-ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT. THE COMPONENTS WILL INCLUDE MODERNIZING LEGISLATION, INFRASTRUCUTRE FINANCING TO ENSURE ACCESSIBILITY, TRAINING AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING. ONE KEY ASPECT OF THE PROJECT IS THAT THE IDB IS CONSIDERING ACTIVITEIS THAT COMPLIMENT EFFORTS ALREADY STARTED BY OTHER DONOR AGENCIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
